{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    
  "trophy_knee_bend_shallow_title": {
    "comment": "Negative feedback title when knee bend is too shallow in trophy phase",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Deine Kniebeugung ist zu gering"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your knee bend is too shallow"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_knee_bend_shallow_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for insufficient knee bend during trophy phase",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Während der Trophy-Phase hilft eine ausreichende Kniebeugung dabei, den Körperschwerpunkt abzusenken und Energie in den Beinen zu speichern. Eine zu geringe Beugung limitiert diese Energiespeicherung und verringert die Effektivität der späteren Aufwärtsbeschleunigung beim Aufschlag"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "During the trophy phase, sufficient knee flexion helps lower the body’s center of mass and store energy in the legs. According to the biomechanical principles of stroke preparation, a shallow knee bend limits this energy storage and reduces the effectiveness of the upward acceleration later in the serve"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_knee_bend_strong_title": {
    "comment": "Positive feedback title for strong lower body loading in trophy phase",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Starke Beinarbeit – sehr gute Kniebeugung"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Strong lower-body loading — great knee bend"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_knee_bend_strong_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for good knee bend in trophy phase",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Deine Kniebeugung bringt dich in eine stabile und gut ausbalancierte Ladeposition. Dadurch kann Energie effizient aus den Beinen in die Aufwärtsbewegung übertragen werden – eine wichtige Grundlage für einen kontrollierten und kraftvollen Aufschlag"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your knee bend places your body in a stable, well-balanced loading position. This supports effective energy transfer from the legs into the upward swing, which is a key requirement for a controlled and powerful serve motion"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_bent_title": {
    "comment": "Negative feedback title when tossing arm is too bent",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Strecke deinen Wurfarm mehr"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Straighten your tossing arm"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_bent_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for bent tossing arm",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Ein deutlich angewinkelter Wurfarm reduziert die Stabilität des Ballwurfs. In der Aufschlagvorbereitung sollte der Wurfarm möglichst gestreckt nach oben geführt werden, um einen ruhigen, wiederholbaren Wurf und eine stabile Oberkörperposition zu unterstützen"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "A noticeably bent tossing arm reduces the stability of the ball toss. In the service preparation phase, the tossing arm should be extended upward to support a calm, repeatable toss and a stable upper-body position"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_extended_title": {
    "comment": "Positive feedback title for well-extended tossing arm",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Sehr gute Streckung des Wurfarms"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Excellent tossing arm extension"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_extended_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for good tossing arm extension",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Dein Wurfarm ist gut gestreckt, was einen ruhigen und kontrollierten Ballwurf unterstützt. Eine saubere Streckung stabilisiert den Oberkörper in der Vorbereitung und ermöglicht eine flüssige Aufschlagbewegung ohne unnötige Korrekturen"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your tossing arm is well extended, which supports a calm and controlled ball toss. An extended tossing arm helps stabilize the upper body during the serve preparation and allows the striking motion to unfold without unnecessary adjustments"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_not_vertical_title": {
    "comment": "Negative feedback title when tossing arm is not vertical",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Führe deinen Wurfarm mehr nach oben"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Point your tossing arm more upward"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_not_vertical_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for poor tossing arm verticality",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Wenn der Wurfarm stark von der Vertikalen abweicht, wird der Ballwurf schwerer kontrollierbar. Eine ruhige, nach oben gerichtete Armbewegung hilft, das Gleichgewicht zu halten und eine konstante Vorbereitung zu erreichen"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "When the tossing arm deviates strongly from a vertical direction, the ball toss becomes harder to control. A calm upward arm action helps maintain balance and a consistent preparation phase"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "trophy_toss_arm_vertical_title": {
    "comment": "Positive feedback title for good tossing arm verticality",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Sehr gute Aufwärtsbewegung des Wurfarms"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Great upward toss direction"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "trophy_toss_arm_vertical_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for good tossing arm verticality",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Dein Wurfarm bewegt sich sauber nach oben, was einen ruhigen und kontrollierten Ballwurf unterstützt. Diese Aufwärtsbewegung stabilisiert die Vorbereitung und ermöglicht einen flüssigen Bewegungsablauf im Aufschlag"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your tossing arm moves in a clean upward direction, which supports a calm and controlled ball toss. This upward action helps maintain balance during the preparation phase and allows the serve motion to develop smoothly"
        }
      }
    }
    },
    
  "hit_behind_arm_not_extended_title": {
    "comment": "Negative feedback title when hitting arm is too bent at contact",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Dein Schlagarm könnte stärker gestreckt sein"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your hitting arm could be more extended"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "hit_behind_arm_not_extended_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for insufficient hitting arm extension at contact",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Ein stark angewinkelter Schlagarm kann die effektive Kraftübertragung im Schlag einschränken. Ein gut gestreckter Arm unterstützt eine effiziente Energieübertragung entlang der kinetischen Kette"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "A strongly bent hitting arm can limit the effective transfer of force through the stroke. An extended arm supports a more efficient energy transmission along the kinetic chain"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "hit_behind_arm_extended_title": {
    "comment": "Positive feedback title for good hitting arm extension at contact",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Sehr gute Armstreckung im Treffpunkt"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Excellent arm extension at contact"
        }
      }
    }
  },

  "hit_behind_arm_extended_detail": {
    "comment": "Detailed explanation for good arm extension at contact",
    "extractionState": "stale",
    "localizations": {
      "de": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Deine Armstreckung im Treffpunkt sorgt für einen stabilen Treffmoment. Dadurch bleibt die kinetische Kette geschlossen und der Schlag folgt den biomechanischen Grundprinzipien"
        }
      },
      "en": {
        "stringUnit": {
          "state": "translated",
          "value": "Your arm extension at contact supports a stable point of contact. This helps maintain continuity in the kinematic chain and allows the stroke to be executed in line with the biomechanical principles"
        }
      }
    }
  },

